  gl_title: 'Madagascar travel guide: RN7, West coast, South-East and Nosy Be',
  gl_desc: 'Madagascar travel guide: Antsirabe, Isalo, Ranomafana, Manakara, Morondava, Tsingy de Bemaraha, Mahajanga, Nosy Be… What to see, and tips from a local driver.',
